--- !u!114 &975714626
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 975714623}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: df4688c3391b51f4eb3a0759e3ef5bd1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestControls
  speechBubble: {fileID: 1172032735}
  talk: {fileID: 1005649869}
  take: {fileID: 1268906301}
  quests:
  - firstText: Oh, you must be the one who woke me up! Welcome! I believe you want
      to return home, aren't you? It won't be an easy task, as kings of the forest
      rarely allow people to escape. Take this, it will help you.
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 1306946135728488428, guid: bf5bcc8e95a44f44a8a6faa9c2f28900, type: 3}
  - firstText: First of all, we need to get rid of the Crow, the wise guy, the most
      dngerous. Bring me it's beak, and we'll discuss the next step.
    secondText: How's the task going?
    gratitude: Well done!
    item: Crow's beak
    questItem: 4
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: 'Now onto the next one: the Hunter. He''s the most persistent. Bring
      me his monocle.'
    secondText: Is he dead?
    gratitude: Great!
    item: Hunter's monocle
    questItem: 6
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: Only the Cat is left, the stealthy one. Get rid of it, bring me it's
      claw, and your path out of the forest will be cleared.
    secondText: Got the claw?
    gratitude: All right!
    item: Cat's claw
    questItem: 5
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 3263355195957557238, guid: 20689157493aa8947a0a699224e85a46, type: 3}
  - firstText: This is it! Step into the light, and go until you get home. Bye!
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  prizeSpawn: {fileID: 1393598319}
