--- !u!114 &1083357252
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1083357244}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: df4688c3391b51f4eb3a0759e3ef5bd1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestControls
  speechBubble: {fileID: 1172032735}
  talk: {fileID: 1359378542}
  take: {fileID: 45712681}
  quests:
  - firstText: Most pleasant evening to you, child! I assume that one of our mutual
      acquaintances has sent you here to get my monocle in exchange of freedom. It
      is only I, however, who can help you escape. I'll train you in the way of a
      woodsman, and you'll easily find your way out.
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: Now, bring me a wolf heart to prove you can handle yourself against
      the powerful game of this place.
    secondText: Have you got the heart?
    gratitude: Marvelous, my child!
    item: wolf heart
    questItem: 1
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 6764396544400260592, guid: 475f9296b912ea044a9cd6161201a82e, type: 3}
  - firstText: And yet there are more powerful beasts in the forest. The Cat is notorious
      for attacking those who try to escape, so you will have to get rid of it before
      it goes on the prowl. Bring me the Cat's claw as a proof if it's demise.
    secondText: So, how did it go?
    gratitude: Spectacular job, my friend!
    item: Cat's claw
    questItem: 5
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: 'Only one little thing remains: the Crow. Damned bird is very capable
      in stalking prey and killing everyone with a powerful pexk to the temple. Bring
      me it''s beak, and you will be ready to return home.'
    secondText: You've got the beak?
    gratitude: Astounding, my old chap, magnificently done!
    item: Crow's beak
    questItem: 4
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 3263355195957557238, guid: a7b708673c6fdf6419f7023425206a4f, type: 3}
  - firstText: While you were at it, I cleared the road through the shortcut. Enter
      these caves and don't stop until you reach your cabin. Adieu!
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  prizeSpawn: {fileID: 1165161300}
