--- !u!114 &1826149243
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1826149235}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: df4688c3391b51f4eb3a0759e3ef5bd1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestControls
  speechBubble: {fileID: 1172032735}
  talk: {fileID: 561421593}
  take: {fileID: 1095216549}
  quests:
  - firstText: 'Hello, sweet child. I see you''ve got the book, and now want to get
      rid of it and return home. I offer you a deal: you help me, and I help you.
      You solve several of my troubles, and I teach you how to sneak and climb and
      swiftly move back home.'
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: The thing is, that owls occupy every tree here, and won't et you go
      easily. Bring me and owl's eye, to prove you can handle them.
    secondText: Is it owl's eye that I spy?
    gratitude: Purr, well done.
    item: owl's eye
    questItem: 3
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 6730037823648739376, guid: d8836a7b3c17cac4d92e17e8e37d963d, type: 3}
  - firstText: As you might know, there is a certain Crow in the forest. After you've
      killed the owl, it is certain to try to take vengeance upon you. Strike first.
      Bring me it's beak.
    secondText: Was it fight or a flight, purr?
    gratitude: Mrreow, I am pleased!
    item: Crow's beak
    questItem: 4
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  - firstText: One last obstacle is the Hunter. He likes to follow those who turn
      their back on the forest. So you'll have to face him head on. Good luck, child!
    secondText: Did you bring me something shiny?
    gratitude: Mrrrahaha, meow, child, you are the Hunter now!
    item: Hunter's monocle
    questItem: 6
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 3263355195957557238, guid: d2b71855478b2d349ab07531cfbe5612, type: 3}
  - firstText: You're finally ready to return home. Just get in these bushes, and
      I'll show you the way.
    secondText: 
    gratitude: 
    item: 
    questItem: 0
    finished: 0
    prize: {fileID: 0}
  prizeSpawn: {fileID: 354369458}
